Interchange RecruitmentAndStaffing
  documentation "This interchange facilitates the exchange of information related to all aspects of the teacher recruitment and application process."
  use case documentation "1. Exchange new or updated recruitment information.
  2. Exchange new or updated applicant and application status information.
  3. Exchange new or updated background check processing and reporting information.
  4. Exchange new or updated professional development event information."
  domain entity ApplicantProfile
  domain entity Application
  domain entity ApplicationEvent
  domain entity ProfessionalDevelopmentEvent
  domain entity ProfessionalDevelopmentEventAttendance
  domain entity Credential
  domain entity RecruitmentEventAttendance
  domain entity RecruitmentEvent
  domain entity Person
